  npcName: "M\xE1 C\u1EE7a An"
  dialogueLines:
  - "An c\u1EE7a m\xE1 v\u1EC1 r\u1ED3i \u0111\xF3 h\u1EA3 con! \u0110i ch\u01A1i tr\xEAn r\u1EEBng c\xF3 m\u1EC7t kh\xF4ng con?"
  - "B\xE0 con trong x\xF3m \u0111ang chu\u1EA9n b\u1ECB ra b\u1EBFn s\xF4ng ti\u1EC5n \u0111o\xE0n t\xE0u n\u0103m 1954. Con gi\u1EEF g\xECn s\u1EE9c kh\u1ECFe, nh\u1EDB l\u1EDDi m\xE1 d\u1EB7n nghen!"
